window.bookSummaryJSON = "When a UFO crashes almost on top of Danielle’s tiny home, she’s convinced that a plane has crashed. The being that staggers out of the wreckage, though, is definitely not human. <br><br>He is badly injured, however. He's a stranger, alone, in a strange land and Danielle feels compelled to help him--to hide him from the people that shot her starman’s spaceship out of the sky.<br><br>Then she discovers he isn't alone. He has company--a lot of company. And he and his people arrived on the tail of an alien invasion by their enemies.<br><br>Which group is the bad aliens? The scary human looking aliens? Or the scarier octopus looking aliens?<br><br>Woman with male harem/multiple heroes."; 
